<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id" class="h-full">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <!-- Google Fonts: Inter -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Tailwind Play CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4"></script>
    <!-- Lucide Icons -->
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background-color: #F5F8F6; }
        .bg-deep-green { background-color: #0B3D2E; }
        .text-deep-green { color: #0B3D2E; }
        .bg-primary-green { background-color: #16845B; }
        .text-primary-green { color: #16845B; }
        .border-border-color { border-color: #DCE7E0; }
        .text-text-muted { color: #64756D; }
        .text-warm-yellow { color: #F4C542; }
        .bg-warm-yellow { background-color: #F4C542; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-full flex items-center justify-center p-4 sm:p-6 lg:p-8">

    <div class="max-w-4xl w-full bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-2xl border border-border-color overflow-hidden grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12">
        
        <!-- KOLOM KIRI: Identitas Klinis, Protokol Medis & Kredensial Cepat -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#0B3D2E] via-[#0d4736] to-[#06241a] text-white p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute -bottom-10 -right-10 w-48 h-48 bg-emerald-500/10 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>

            <div>
                <!-- Top Nav Back Links -->
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6 text-xs">
                    <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-300 font-semibold hover:text-white transition">
                        <i data-lucide="arrow-left" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
                        <span>Beranda Utama</span>
                    </a>
                    <a href="/login" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-amber-300 font-semibold hover:text-white transition" title="Pindah ke Login Khusus Wali Santri">
                        <span>Pintu Masuk Wali</span>
                        <i data-lucide="external-link" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
                    </a>
                </div>

                <!-- Brand Monogram -->
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-primary-green flex items-center justify-center text-white font-extrabold text-xl shadow-lg border border-emerald-400/40">
                        AB
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <span class="inline-block px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-900/90 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-700/60 font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold">
                            INTERNAL MEDIS
                        </span>
                        <h1 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold text-white leading-tight">
                            Poskestren Al-Bahjah
                        </h1>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <p class="text-xs text-emerald-200/80 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                    Sistem Operasional & SPK Triase Klinis Poskestren Al-Bahjah Cabang Bogor. Portal ini dikhususkan bagi <strong>Tenaga Medis, Dokter, Perawat, Apoteker, dan Administrator</strong>.
                </p>

                <!-- KREDENSIAL PENGUJIAN CEPAT -->
                <div class="bg-emerald-950/90 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-emerald-700/60 shadow-inner mb-4">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5">
                        <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-300 flex items-center gap-1">
                            <i data-lucide="key-round" class="w-3 h-3 text-warm-yellow"></i>
                            Pilih Akun Demo Petugas:
                        </span>
                        <span class="text-[9px] px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded bg-emerald-800 text-emerald-200 font-mono">1-Klik Isi</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="space-y-1.5 text-xs">
                        <button type="button" onclick="isiAkun('admin', 'admin123')" class="w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-emerald-900/80 hover:bg-primary-green text-white flex items-center justify-between transition text-left group border border-emerald-800/50">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                <i data-lucide="shield-check" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-warm-yellow group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"></i>
                                <span class="font-semibold text-[11px]">Dokter Koordinator (Admin)</span>
                            </div>
                            <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-300 group-hover:text-white font-mono bg-emerald-950/80 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">admin</span>
                        </button>

                        <button type="button" onclick="isiAkun('nakes1', 'admin123')" class="w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-emerald-900/80 hover:bg-primary-green text-white flex items-center justify-between transition text-left group border border-emerald-800/50">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                <i data-lucide="stethoscope" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-400 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"></i>
                                <span class="font-semibold text-[11px]">Perawat / Nakes Triase</span>
                            </div>
                            <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-300 group-hover:text-white font-mono bg-emerald-950/80 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">nakes1</span>
                        </button>

                        <button type="button" onclick="isiAkun('farmasi1', 'admin123')" class="w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-emerald-900/80 hover:bg-primary-green text-white flex items-center justify-between transition text-left group border border-emerald-800/50">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                <i data-lucide="pill" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-rose-300 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"></i>
                                <span class="font-semibold text-[11px]">Apoteker / Petugas Farmasi</span>
                            </div>
                            <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-300 group-hover:text-white font-mono bg-emerald-950/80 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">farmasi1</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Footer Kolom Kiri -->
            <div class="text-[11px] text-emerald-300/60 pt-4 border-t border-emerald-800/50 flex items-center justify-between">
                <span>Node.js Express + MySQL</span>
                <span class="flex items-center gap-1">
                    <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
                    Sistem Medis Aktif
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- KOLOM KANAN: Form Autentikasi Tunggal Khusus Petugas Medis -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 p-6 sm:p-10 flex flex-col justify-center bg-white">
            
            <!-- Header Form -->
            <div class="mb-6">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-deep-green text-xs font-bold mb-3 border border-emerald-200">
                    <i data-lucide="activity" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-primary-green"></i>
                    <span>Autentikasi Tenaga Medis Poskestren</span>
                </div>
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-deep-green tracking-tight">
                    Masuk ke Sistem Petugas
                </h2>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-text-muted mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                    Kelola antrean klinis, kalkulasi SPK triase SAW, rekam medis santri, mutasi farmasi, dan laporan terpadu.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Pesan Kesalahan / Notifikasi -->
            <% if (error) { %>
                <div class="mb-5 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-red-50 border border-red-200 text-red-800 text-xs font-medium flex items-start gap-2.5">
                    <i data-lucide="alert-triangle" class="w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 text-red-600 mt-0.5"></i>
                    <div class="leading-relaxed"><%- error %></div>
                </div>
            <% } %>

            <% if (success) { %>
                <div class="mb-5 p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-medium flex items-center gap-2.5">
                    <i data-lucide="check-circle" class="w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary-green"></i>
                    <span><%- success %></span>
                </div>
            <% } %>

            <!-- FORM LOGIN PETUGAS -->
            <form method="POST" action="/login-petugas" class="space-y-4">
                <div>
                    <label for="inputUsername" class="block text-xs font-bold text-text-main mb-1.5">
                        Username Petugas / ID Nakes
                    </label>
                    <div class="relative">
                        <input type="text" name="username" id="inputUsername" required placeholder="Masukkan username (admin, nakes1, farmasi1)" 
                               class="w-full pl-9 pr-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-border-color bg-[#F5F8F6] text-xs font-medium text-text-main placeholder-slate-400 focus:bg-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-green transition">
                        <i data-lucide="user" class="w-4 h-4 text-text-muted absolute left-3 top-3"></i>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1.5">
                        <label for="inputPassword" class="block text-xs font-bold text-text-main">
                            Kata Sandi Petugas
                        </label>
                        <span class="text-[11px] text-text-muted">Default Demo: <code class="bg-slate-100 px-1 py-0.5 rounded text-deep-green font-mono">admin123</code></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative">
                        <input type="password" name="password" id="inputPassword" required placeholder="Masukkan kata sandi akun nakes..." 
                               class="w-full pl-9 pr-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-border-color bg-[#F5F8F6] text-xs font-medium text-text-main placeholder-slate-400 focus:bg-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-green transition">
                        <i data-lucide="lock" class="w-4 h-4 text-text-muted absolute left-3 top-3"></i>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <button type="submit" class="w-full py-3 rounded-xl bg-deep-green hover:bg-primary-green text-white font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm shadow-md transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mt-2">
                    <i data-lucide="log-in" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                    <span>Masuk ke Dashboard Medis</span>
                </button>

                <!-- Edukasi Wali Santri -->
                <div class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/80 border border-amber-200 text-amber-900 text-xs flex items-start gap-2.5 mt-4">
                    <i data-lucide="info" class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"></i>
                    <div class="leading-relaxed">
                        <strong>Perhatian:</strong> Halaman ini tidak dapat digunakan oleh Wali Santri. Untuk Orang Tua / Wali yang ingin memantau kesehatan ananda, silakan gunakan 
                        <a href="/login" class="font-bold underline text-deep-green hover:text-primary-green">
                            Pintu Masuk Khusus Wali Santri →
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </form>

            <!-- Tautan Cepat Beranda -->
            <div class="pt-6 border-t border-slate-100 text-center text-xs text-text-muted flex items-center justify-between">
                <a href="/" class="text-deep-green hover:text-primary-green font-semibold inline-flex items-center gap-1">
                    <i data-lucide="home" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
                    <span>Kembali ke Beranda</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/wali" class="text-primary-green hover:underline font-semibold inline-flex items-center gap-1">
                    <span>Portal Publik Wali Santri</span>
                    <i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
                </a>
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

    <script>
        if (typeof lucide !== 'undefined') {
            lucide.createIcons();
        }

        function isiAkun(username, password) {
            document.getElementById('inputUsername').value = username;
            document.getElementById('inputPassword').value = password;
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
